The locale of your shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> instance is the value detected <https://github.com/rstudio/rsconnect/blob/ee81aac4341e99efccec22547701e12c585da3ad/R/bundle.R#L362> by the rsconnect package when it constructs the manifest for the bundle that is uploaded.
And the encoding of the project is detected <https://github.com/rstudio/rsconnect/blob/5ae03934958b71e1954fea1d5c0fb1aa17369b99/R/deployApp.R#L205> from the .Rproj file.

If you are certain that those values are proper, could you tell what your account name & application name are and I can look a little further.

